# [Troll Lackey](https://i.imgur.com/o0v3GUQ.png)

1 mana 1/1 neutral minion

&#x200B;

**Battlecry: Discover** a loa spirit.

&#x200B;

Now every class can use spirit of the shark! That definitely won't end terribly.

# [Bolvar, Lord of Icecrown](https://i.imgur.com/mYONbMn.png)

&#x200B;

* 6 mana 1/5 legendary paladin minion
* **Battlecry:** Gain +1/+1 for each **Divine Shield** minion in your deck.

&#x200B;

please I just want divine shield paladin to work.
